import Game.Levels.ChangeOfBasis.L06_NormalForm

World "ChangeOfBasis"
Title "Change of Basis"

Introduction "
Hefferon Three.V. The same map has many matrices, one for each choice of bases; they are
related by change-of-basis matrices $\\mathrm{Rep}(\\mathrm{id})$. This world ends with the
classification: two matrices represent the same map (in suitable bases) exactly when they
have the same rank.
"
